menu "Locker reset button"

    config LC_RESET_BUTTON_GPIO
        int "Reset button GPIO"
        range 0 39
        default 4
        help
            A button from this pin to GND, with the internal pull-up. Held for
            10 s and released, it wipes identity, mapping and network settings
            and keeps the command journal (ADR-0074). The build refuses strapping,
            flash, input-only, console and RS485 pins.

endmenu
